{
 "name": "TestBoard_7953 PZT front end (one ADS7953)",
 "description": "15 PZT sensors on the channels of one ADS7953 (16-channel mux + 12-bit SAR ADC), a shared OPA365 buffer between MXO and AINP with a bias resistor to VMID, and the ADC sample-and-hold. SPI frame timing drives the mux and the hold; while the other ADC pair is clocked this mux is parked on VMID (channel 15). VREF 2.5 V, VMID 1.25 V, 20 MHz SPI.",
 "config": "config.json",
 "adapter": "simulator_adapter.py",
 "components": [
